  "note": "The model depicts the rebuilt M-07 crossing near Hostomel. The Romanivka Bridge of Life is a separate site. The deck centerlines, sidewalk edges, and connections follow OpenStreetMap via Protomaps. Pier positions, the grade crest, and their elevations are exterior reconstructions. The generator models both separated decks, retaining wings, transverse pier caps, blue-gray sidewalk fencing, galvanized barriers, and light poles. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
